---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Pedestrian Injuries Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Hit by a vehicle while walking in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office helps pedestrian accident victims recover compensation. Call (415) 360-5266."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-pedestrian.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" loading="eager" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark/95 via-dark/80 to-slate-900/60"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dark/20"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Pedestrian Injury Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">A normal walk can turn into a serious and painful experience if you are hit by a car. A pedestrian injury lawyer in San Francisco is able to assist with getting to know your rights.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">A normal walk can turn into a serious and painful experience if you are hit by a car. One minute you are walking across a street or through a parking lot. Then you could be looking at broken bones, medical bills, lost work and weeks or even months of recovery. You are probably wondering who will pay for your losses and what to do next.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">A pedestrian injury lawyer in San Francisco is able to assist with getting to know your rights. At The Sulfab Law Office, we determine the cause of an incident, the people who might have been at fault, and help you pursue the compensation you may be entitled to.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">How We Help</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">How a Pedestrian Injury Lawyer in San Francisco Can Help</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">A pedestrian accident can leave you with more questions than answers. You might be recovering from your injuries while being interrogated by insurance companies for statements and documents. It is recommended to have a professional attorney represent you through the process.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">A pedestrian injury attorney in San Francisco ensures that all your rights are safeguarded from the very beginning. The Sulfab Law Office investigates the accident, collects all the evidence required, and explains everything in simple language. In addition, our attorneys will handle all communication with the insurance company.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium mb-4">We can help with:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="text-gold font-bold">•</span> Incident investigation</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="text-gold font-bold">•</span> Witness statements and police report collection</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="text-gold font-bold">•</span> Review of your medical records and accident evidence</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="text-gold font-bold">•</span> Insurance company negotiation</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="text-gold font-bold">•</span> Compensation for your losses</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Our goal is to build a strong case to help you get the financial recovery you deserve.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Common Causes of Pedestrian Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">The main reasons for most pedestrian accidents are inattentiveness or negligence of the driver. Other reasons can be poor road conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Distracted driving / texting while driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Speeding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Driving under the influence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Reckless driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Fatigued driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Backing into a pedestrian</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Poor visibility</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Failure to follow traffic signal</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Injuries After a Pedestrian Crash</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">A vehicle can cause severe harm to a person on foot. Treatment may take several months or even years to cure such injuries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Brain and Head Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Head trauma from being struck by a vehicle frequently causes concussions and severe brain damage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Spinal Cord Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Impact can damage the spinal cord, leading to paralysis and permanent effects on mobility.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Bone Breaks and Fractures</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Commonly suffer multiple fractures requiring surgical intervention and lengthy rehabilitation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Internal Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Blunt force trauma can cause internal bleeding and organ damage requiring emergency surgery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all md:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Soft Tissue, Bruises and Cuts</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Muscle and ligament damage can cause chronic pain and long-term impairment. If you have been injured by a vehicle and want to receive compensation, consult a pedestrian accident lawyer in San Francisco.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Liability</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Who May Be Responsible?</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Determining who's at fault can sometimes be tricky. In a pedestrian accident case, there are several things that California law considers. This can include where the pedestrian was walking, traffic lights, crosswalks, the driver's actions and road conditions.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Sometimes multiple parties may be liable for the accident. If poor road design, a broken traffic signal or another dangerous public condition contributed to the accident, a government agency or another party may also be liable. Every case depends on its specific facts.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">We examine the facts of your case to determine the liable parties.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compensation You May Seek</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">In cases where someone else's carelessness led to your injury, you may be entitled to get compensated for:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical Expenses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your hospital expenses and expected medical expenses in the future.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Lost Income</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Lost income and reduced earning capacity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Pain & Suffering</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Pain and suffering, emotional stress, loss of life's pleasures and loss of enjoyment of life.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What must I do following a pedestrian accident?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Call emergency services, receive medical attention and inform the police about the accident. Take photographs of the accident scene and any injuries sustained. Additionally, obtain contact information from the driver and witnesses. Do not make statements that may blame you regarding the accident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">How much is a pedestrian accident claim worth?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">There is no set amount. The value of the claim is dependent on your injuries, the cost of medical treatment, loss of earnings, pain and suffering, among others. An attorney can evaluate your claim.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What if my injuries appeared days after the accident?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Some injuries may not cause symptoms right away. It is advisable to visit the doctor as quickly as possible after the accident. Medical documentation will also assist in linking your injuries with the accident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What if I was injured in a crosswalk?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you got into an accident at a crosswalk, evidence that would be considered would be factors relating to the actual event, such as traffic lights, pictures, witness statements from people who saw what happened, or security camera video footage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Is my accident case going to court?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Sometimes no. Most pedestrian accident cases do not have to go to court; they get settled out of court through negotiations with the insurance company.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Contact Our San Francisco Legal Team</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Once you have been involved in a pedestrian accident, there are many things that need to be done within a certain period of time. If you suffered any injuries after being hit by a vehicle, then The Sulfab Law Office can advise you on what to do next. Give us a call at (415) 360-5266 right now for a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
